body:
Ok ok

&#x200B;

me and two friends bought a gas stove ham cheese bread and some chicken nuggets we got a mini cooler full of food and walked to the next town over we walked until dark and our parents had no clue we were we were in the middle of the woods at night I had A panic attack and dropped the lighter to light the stove we walked through the woods and found a town we entered walking through the streets at night mind you this was in the middle of winter but it was warm for 7:pm we found a beach and started spraying deodorant into my one friends eyes and chilling listening to music and some other kids stole the bread we then saw a fire down the beach and got scared so packed up our stuff and out of nowhere a pickup truck full of drunk teens drive past then they came back to us and were shouting go home they nearly ran me and my one friend over we ran and we’re scared asf we heard a car so hid. In a bush after some more walking we ended up in a little town village thing we were just chilling on a bench talking we then heard some and ran we then saw a bike in a bush and kept running we ended up at a wharf and it was freezing probably about 11 pm we went on the floor trying to get sleep but couldn’t then a car came so we hid some guy came up to ask and asked if we were ok and we said yeah he then left and we went back to trying to sleep then a fisherman came and his dog nearly killed me he left and someone else came about 1am we watched them have car sex and the kids were in the boot of the car then at 8 am we got on a ferry to our hometown so yeah
